    "created_at": "2016-08-09T09:14:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-09T09:14:46Z",
    "body": "Exposing limits is a little odd as we'd expect those to go up over time. We don't really expose any limits at the moment in HTML. (Once we expose them folks might start depending on particular values and such.)\n\nExposing tainting seems reasonable.\n",
